{"id":5108,"date":"2020-10-15T16:43:23","date_gmt":"2020-10-15T15:43:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/?p=5108"},"modified":"2022-12-02T11:02:43","modified_gmt":"2022-12-02T10:02:43","slug":"travaux-sur-les-rails","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/travaux-sur-les-rails\/","title":{"rendered":"Travaux sur les rails"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Le gazon du TRAM reprendra sa place.<\/p>\n<p><!--more--><br \/>\nVous apercevez actuellement des travaux dans la courbe de la voie du Tram, rue de la Robertsau. Ces derniers sont d\u00e9terr\u00e9s car une non-conformit\u00e9 a \u00e9t\u00e9 observ\u00e9e au niveau des attaches de rails. Durant les travaux, la terre engazonn\u00e9e est d\u00e9caiss\u00e9e sur la largeur compl\u00e8te de la plate-forme et sur un lin\u00e9aire d\u2019environ 150 m.<\/p>\n<p>D\u00e8s la remise en place conforme des rails, les plaques de gazon seront replac\u00e9es.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Le gazon du TRAM reprendra sa place.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":5109,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_expiration-date-status":"","_expiration-date":0,"_expiration-date-type":"","_expiration-date-categories":[],"_expiration-date-options":[]},"categories":[31,87],"tags":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5108"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/6"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=5108"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.ville-hoenheim.fr\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/5108\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":511